<div class="feature_content item5">
<div class="feature-top"></div>
<div class="feature-mid">
<p>Beijing Axis Capital provides independent corporate finance advisory and transaction origination services. We have a specialist China-focused approach with extensive international and Africa-specific knowledge and experience.<a href="/track-record/capital" class="button">Read more</a></p>
</div>
</div>	</div>

